WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.770
There aren't too many great things about being a CEO or a senior executive.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.350
Well, maybe there are.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.530
But one of the better ones is having a chief of staff.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.490
That's someone who helps organize the work, keeps track of commitments, and moves the work forward.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.990
Now, in the AI era, you don't have to be a senior leader to get one.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.210
You can just build one for yourself.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:28.530
And you decide its personality, so it never annoys you, not even before coffee.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.430
And it can handle anything you throw its way.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.290
So in this adventure, you design the ultimate one.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:41.170
You teach it how you work, what you need help with, and what it needs to know to be a trusted advisor.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:46.410
Then you build your to-do board, so you can see your whole week and what comes first.
